cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CuHalide Atlas, cite the versioned public resource, include the access date when required, and consult the known-errata notice."
title: "CuHalide Atlas"
version: "3.0.1"
date-released: "2026-08-10"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "CuHalide Atlas Project"
url: "https://cuhalide-atlas-v3.vercel.app/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/zion0321/CuHalide-Atlas"
abstract: >-
  Evidence-grounded, structure-resolved public knowledge portal for
  organic-containing Cu(I) chlorides, bromides and iodides. Release 3.0.1 is a
  bibliographic-only patch over the 3.0.0 scientific parent. Public access is
  query-and-view through selected bibliographic, structural, crystallographic
  and photophysical fields plus evidence-grounded Smart RAG. Complete
  normalized tables, exact stored publisher abstracts, primary PDF/SI/CIF
  files and internal curation/audit artifacts are not distributed through the
  public website. A disclosed Record 13 dimensionality erratum is transparently
  corrected in the public effective display pending scientific hotfix 3.0.2.
keywords:
  - copper(I) halide
  - Cu(I)-I
  - copper iodide
  - crystallography
  - luminescence
  - self-trapped exciton
  - scientific knowledge portal
  - retrieval-augmented generation
